Package: netfs
Type: Package
Title: Unified Filesystem Operations for Local and Remote Connections
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("netfs", "authors", email = "maintainers@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a small, consistent interface for filesystem operations on
    local paths and remote FTP, SSH, and SMB connections. Local operations
    delegate to 'fs'; remote operations use mature protocol tools.
